<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% block title %}AIRE audit dashboard{% endblock %}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar"><a href="/">AIRE</a> <span class="meta">· local read-only audit dashboard</span></div>
<main>
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
</main>
<footer>
Findings are detected conditions with evidence pointers (event id + SHA-256) —
not a compliance certification. This dashboard is read-only and local; it never
modifies the evidence store and serves no external resources. Verify integrity
with <code>aire verify</code>.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
